  {
    "name": "xxh3_64",
    "categories": [
      "xxHash"
    ],
    "description": "64-bit xxHash3 (XXH3_64) — the modern xxHash variant tuned for vectorized CPUs (SSE2/AVX2). Faster than `xxh64` on virtually all modern hardware, especially for short inputs, with comparable distribution quality.\n\nThis is the recommended general-purpose 64-bit non-cryptographic hash for partitioning, sharding, deduplication, and as input to probabilistic filters in bitfilters.",
